00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:29.820
plan to align with EU-wide timing. Tesla highlighted the development in a recent statement.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:34.900
The move positions Czechia ahead of other EU markets on the software rollout.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:40.720
According to electric-vehicles.com, this marks a distinct step for the region.

