00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:15.120
Homeowners continue to navigate extended weight periods in some regions.

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:20.200
Supply chain audits for new hardware programs often focus on cost and volume.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:25.520
yet the real constraint lies in how quickly suppliers can meet consistent quality at scale.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:31.540
Tesla's recent supplier reviews in China for Optimus target specialized components whose

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:37.280
tolerances directly affect robot repeatability and energy use. When those tolerances slip,

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:44.000
training data quality drops and iteration cycles lengthen. Grid scale storage projects reveal

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:50.960
a different limit. An 8-hour battery built from 144 Mp in Australia shows that duration,

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:56.540
not just capacity, now drives project economics in markets shifting toward renewables.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:07:02.120
Longer duration systems change how operators schedule generation and reduce reliance on

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:08.480
peaker plants during extended low output periods. Financing terms for residential solar illustrate

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:16.280
the gap between early incentives and current capital costs. A 0.99% loan from 2021 is reaching

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:23.020
its final payment while new rates sit above 7%. That shift alters payback calculations for new

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:29.080
buyers and affects how quickly solar plus storage attaches to homes without legacy low-rate financing.

